# gh1.script -- GH1 repro: open SYSACC from the Desk menu (acc.script geometry), click the "Next start"
# popup button of row 2 (Address-space IDs, ~480,250 on 640x480), leave the popup open 7 s, Esc cancels it,
# wait 7 s, click Cancel (~468,455) to close the dialog, wait. Ticks 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up".
